            <row>
              <entry>EU</entry>
              <entry>European Union / Economic Bloc</entry>
              <entry>21 May 2026</entry>
            </row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table>
    </section>

    <section id="registration-thresholds">
      <title>Changes to VAT Registration Thresholds</title>
      <p>No changes to VAT registration thresholds in this release.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="vat-rates">
      <title>Changes to VAT Rates</title>
      <p>No VAT rate changes in this release.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="taxability-exemption-rules">
      <title>Changes to Taxability and Exemption Rules</title>
      <p><b>What changed:</b> The following jurisdiction had a change to VAT scope/taxability
        treatment.</p>
      <p outputclass="jurisdiction-heading"><b>European Union</b></p>
      <dl outputclass="change-card">
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Tax Type</dt>
          <dd>Value Added Tax (VAT)</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Change Title</dt>
          <dd>Domestic VAT Out-of-Scope Expansion</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Citations</dt>
          <dd>EU Commission Directive 2026/X42</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Effective Date</dt>
          <dd>2026-05-21</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Updates</dt>
          <dd>Domestic VAT Out-of-Scope provision expanded to include service and digital
            transaction types (previously limited primarily to product transactions).</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Summary</dt>
          <dd>The Domestic VAT Out-of-Scope provision in the European Union was expanded
            effective May 21, 2026.</dd>
        </dlentry>
        <dlentry>
          <dt>Impact</dt>
          <dd>Out-of-Scope treatment has been expanded to include service and digital
            transaction types. Prior to this change, treatment was primarily limited to product
            transactions.</dd>
        </dlentry>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section id="tax-codes">
      <title>Updated Tax Codes</title>
      <p>No changes.</p>
